 (1) no ancillary dwelling units shall be permitted in a basement or cellar; and
 (2) no backyard ancillary dwelling units shall be permitted;
(c) in R1-2A, R2A and R3A Districts, or portions thereof, located beyond the Greater Transit Zone, no backyard ancillary dwelling units shall be permitted;
